			</p>
			<h2>Redes Sociais</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><a href="https://x.com/JulioScouter" target="_blank">X (Twitter)</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/radiotatuapefm" target="_blank">Instagram</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/tatuapefm" target="_blank">Facebook Rádio</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/likelooksolutionsti" target="_blank">Facebook Like Look</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://github.com/AstridNielsen-lab" target="_blank">GitHub</a></li>
